09/27/2026

latest process for density number analysis for finding the space charge parameter

run auto.sh to submit jobs
-change number of splits and number of events per split depending on how much events are in runs and available time
-recommended upper limit is around 100k events, most runs are in 50k to 70k range

after jobs are finished, analyze with SCfind.sh
-the latest cuts to use are both vtx z sig cuts and multiplicity cuts

after analysis is complete, can compare delta Vx over avg trigger rate with SCcombine.sh

